  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "text": "Five Mics (Mobile TCG)",
          "type": "h1"
        },
        {
          "text": "A mobile trading card game bringing hip-hop culture into play",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Designed and implemented the UI/UX for a hip-hop-inspired mobile trading card game, redesigning onboarding, building social features, and creating core gameplay interfaces with a bold visual language, bringing interactions to life in Unity with a focus on clarity and player engagement.",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Team",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Five Mics Studios",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "MY ROLE",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "UI/UX Designer, Technical Implementation",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "TOOLS",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Figma, Unity, C#, Adobe Photoshop, Adobe Illustrator",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Timeline",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Aug 2023 - Aug 2024",
          "type": "p"
        }
      ],
      "name": "Header"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "text": "01",
          "type": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Project Objectives",
          "type": "h1"
        },
        {
          "text": "GOAL",
          "type": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Adapt desktop gameplay for mobile with a seamless interface.",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Enhance UI accessibility and visual appeal.",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Design intuitive onboarding for new players.",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Strengthen social features to boost player interaction.",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "CHALLENGE",
          "type": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Design a clear and intuitive interface to guide players while addressing the visual presentation of complex interactions.",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "RESPONSIBILITIES",
          "type": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "UI/UX Design - Transforming physical to digital",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Visual Direction - Setting visual style and vibe",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Implementation - Hand-off with Unity UI and interactions built by C#",
          "type": "p"
        }
      ],
      "name": "Project"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "text": "02",
          "type": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Visual Direction",
          "type": "h1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Starting with visual keywords from the founder, I explored mood boards and narrowed the direction to a balance between cyberpunk futurism and graffiti-inspired street culture. Referencing games like Marvel Snap, I extracted a focused palette of bold, saturated colors grounded by dark neutrals to capture the energy of hip-hop while keeping the UI clear and cohesive.",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/qIqRWOP887U7ss6igBVJVoE0.png?width=2000&height=1125",
          "type": "img"
        },
        {
          "text": "Mood Board",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "text": "Color Palette",
          "type": "p"
        }
      ],
      "name": "Visual Style"
