          "text": "05",
          "type": "h2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Unity Implementation",
          "type": "h1"
        },
        {
          "text": "After iterating on the UI with the team, I implemented the responsive interfaces in Unity, including button animations, scene transitions, and drag-and-drop interactions. I also created custom shaders for holographic card upgrades to enhance visual feedback and reinforce the game’s visual identity.",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "src": "https://player.vimeo.com/video/1043050032?muted=1&autoplay=1&autopause=0&controls=0&loop=1&app_id=122963",
          "type": "iframe"
        },
        {
          "text": "Button Animation",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "src": "https://player.vimeo.com/video/1043049606?muted=1&autoplay=1&autopause=0&controls=0&loop=1&app_id=122963",
          "type": "iframe"
        },
        {
